  "operative_text": "Section 1 (NRS 202.300): 5. Unless a greater penalty is provided by law, a person is guilty of a misdemeanor who: (a) Negligently stores or leaves a firearm at a location under his or her control; and (b) Knows or has reason to know that there is a substantial risk that a child prohibited from handling or having in his or her possession or under his or her control any firearm pursuant to this section may obtain such a firearm."
